--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FlashAttention
    https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention
    Tri Dao and collaborators

The IO-aware attention design this project applies to a different attention
math. Specific adaptations, each marked at its site in the source:

  * csrc/static_switch.h        adapted from FlashAttention's static_switch.h
  * csrc/nystrom_utils.h        the CuTe GEMM helpers, the MMA accumulator
                                layout conversions, and the in-register
                                softmax primitives follow FlashAttention's
                                implementations
  * csrc/kernels/*.cuh          the tiling structure, the online (running
                                maximum) softmax, the transposed shared-memory
                                views for the second GEMM's B operand, and the
                                warp-partitioned TiledMma shapes follow
                                FlashAttention's patterns

Refer to the upstream repository for its license terms.

