Baselines used for comparison only

The following are imported as optional dependencies for benchmarking. No code
from them is vendored here; each is installed from its own distribution under
its own license.

  * flash-attn         https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention
                       (FlashAttention-2/3, and its fused windowed kernel used
                       as the sliding-window baseline)
  * flash_bla          https://github.com/fla-org/flash-bidirectional-linear-attention
                       (fused bidirectional linear attention baseline)
  * mamba-ssm, causal-conv1d, and the Hyena reference implementation, for the
    MQAR baselines
